{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/1.gif?t=1750487861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore mysterious architectural spaces with oppressive, liminal atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/2.gif?t=1750487861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete mini-game tasks to uncover fragmented clues about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/3.gif?t=1750487861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access system terminals to retrieve vague intel about other players\u2019 identities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/4.gif?t=1750487861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make choices based on clues to speculate about your own or others\u2019 true identities: Who are you? Who are they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/extras/5.gif?t=1750487861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you can successfully identify someone, you can eliminate them, but stay sharp: you might be next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733860?t=1750487861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733860?t=1750487861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/3b948e6216dd3ce8d6127f2e8a9575f329a6b0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750487861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733860/3b948e6216dd3ce8d6127f2e8a9575f329a6b0a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750487861","